  rxPin: ["RX pin (receives the radar's TX)", "Pin RX (recibe el TX del radar)", "RX-Pin (empfängt das TX des Radars)", "Broche RX (reçoit le TX du radar)", "Pin RX (riceve il TX del radar)", "RXピン（レーダーのTXを受信）", "RX 引脚（接收雷达的TX）", "Pino RX (recebe o TX do radar)"],
  txPin: ["TX pin (sends to the radar's RX)", "Pin TX (envía al RX del radar)", "TX-Pin (sendet an das RX des Radars)", "Broche TX (envoie au RX du radar)", "Pin TX (invia all'RX del radar)", "TXピン（レーダーのRXへ送信）", "TX 引脚（发送到雷达的RX）", "Pino TX (envia para o RX do radar)"],
